        <span itemprop="definition">were used to measure properties of the porous film ( 2 ), the laminated porous film ( 2 ), and a porous film, which was left after removal of the porous layer from the laminated porous film ( 2 ).</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0132">
      </li>
