        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0134">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the measurement methods described above</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">were used to measure properties of the porous film ( 3 ), the laminated porous film ( 3 ), and a porous film, which was left after removal of the porous layer from the laminated porous film ( 3 ). Tables 2 and 3 show the measurement results.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0134">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
