      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the coating solution B</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was then applied by gravure method to that surface of the porous film ( 3 ) to which the corona treatment had been performed, and was then dried.</span>
