      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the nonaqueous electrolyte secondary battery laminated separator of an embodiment of the present invention</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is therefore usable in production of a nonaqueous electrolyte secondary battery having a good output characteristic and a high level of safety.</span>
